# Copy this to .env and you have a working local setup:  cp .env.example .env
#
# Every value below is PUBLISHABLE BY DESIGN. Vite inlines VITE_* into the
# browser bundle, so these are already public the moment the site is served -
# they are real values here on purpose, not placeholders.
#
# WARNING: NOTHING SECRET GOES IN .env OR HERE. No Acuity API key, no Stripe
# secret key, no Supabase service-role key. Those live in Supabase Edge Function
# secrets (Project Settings -> Edge Functions), which is where the acuity
# function reads ACUITY_USER_ID / ACUITY_API_KEY from.
#
# For running scripts/ locally against Acuity, put credentials in .env.local -
# that is gitignored. Get them from Acuity -> Integrations -> API.

